        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_34",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_35",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "OTHER POWERS OF THE AGENCY Power to appoint Innovation Ambassador"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII",
      "@type": "akn:part",
      "eli:number": "VII",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_38",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_42",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_45",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_46"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "MISCELLANEOUS ' Obligation of secrecy"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_38",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "38",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_38__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_38__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_38__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Except for any of the purposes of this Act or for the purpose of any civil or criminal proceedings under any written law, no member of the Council or committee, officer or employee of the Agency, or any person invited to attend any meeting of the Council or committee shall disclose any information which has been obtained by him in the course of his duties and which is not published in pursuance of this Act."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_38__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_38",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one million ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both. Public Authorities Protection Act 1948"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "39",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Public Authorities Protection Act 1948 [Act 198] shall apply to any action, suit, prosecution or proceedings against the Agency or against any member of the Council, any member of the committee or any officer, employee, Innovation Ambassador or agent of the Agency, in respect of any act, neglect, default or omission done by it or him in such capacity. Public servant"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_40",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "40",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Every member of the Council or any committee, or any officer, employee, Innovation Ambassador or agent of the Agency, while discharging his duty under this Act as such member, officer, employee, Innovation Ambassador or agent, shall be deemed to be a public servant within the meaning of the Penal Code [Act 574]. Power to make regulations"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_41",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "41",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Prime Minister may, on the recommendation of the Agency, make regulations as may be necessary for the better carrying out of the provisions of this Act. Offence for providing false or misleading information"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_42",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "42",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A person who provides, or cause any person to provide, information to the Agency which he knows or has reason to believe is false or misleading, commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one million ringgit or to an imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both. Offence for unauthorized modification of the information or documents"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "43",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A person commits an offence if he does any act, or causes any person to do any act, which he knows will cause unauthorized modification of any information, statistic or other data, whether in electronic form or otherwise, in the possession, custody or control of the Agency."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this section—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "it is immaterial that the act in question is not directed at—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any particular information, statistic or data;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "information, statistic or data of any kind; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any information, statistic or data held in any particular location;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "it is immaterial whether an unauthorized modification is, or is intended to be, permanent or merely temporary;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a modification of any information, statistic or data takes place if—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "such information, statistic or data is altered or erased;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any new information, statistic or data is introduced or added to such information, statistic or data; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_2__para_c",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any event occurs which impairs the ability of the Agency to have access to such information, statistic or data, and includes any act that contributes towards causing such modification."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_43",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A person who commits an offence under this section shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one million ringgit or to an imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both. Validity of acts and proceedings"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "44",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No act done or proceeding taken under this Act shall be questioned on the ground of—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any vacancy in the membership of, or any defect in the constitution of, the Council or a committee; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_44",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any omission, defect or irregularity not affecting the merits of the case. Acts done in anticipation of the enactment of this Act"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_45",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "45",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All acts done on behalf of the Agency in preparation for or in anticipation of the enactment of this Act and any expenditure incurred in relation thereto, shall be deemed to have been authorized under this Act, provided that the acts done are consistent with the general intention and purposes of this Act; and all rights acquired or obligations incurred as a result of the doing of those acts including any expenditure incurred in relation thereto shall, upon the coming into operation of this Act, be deemed to be the rights and obligations of the Agency. Vesting of rights, interests, obligations and liabilities upon expiry of Act"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII__cl_46",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "46",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VII",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Upon the expiry of this Act, all rights, interests, obligations and liabilities derived, acquired, incurred or vested under this Act by or in the Agency shall be vested in the Ministry of Finance."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "31",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_7"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Agency may, in consultation with any ministry, Government institution or agency and Federal Government linked company, appoint such number of Innovation Ambassadors to advise the Ministry, Government institution or agency and Federal Government linked company on matters relating to innovation as the Agency considers necessary."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The person appointed under subsection (1) as an Innovation Ambassador shall be paid such remuneration or allowances by the Agency as the Agency may determine."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Innovation Ambassador shall be under the general control of, and shall report to, the Agency."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of subsection (1), the Innovation Ambassador shall be placed at the Ministry, Government institution or agency and Federal Government linked company."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The terms and conditions of the placement and the matters to be advised by the Innovation Ambassador shall be agreed upon by the Agency and the Ministry, Government institution or agency and the Federal Government linked company concerned."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Innovation Ambassador shall table a report to the Council with regard to his placement at the Ministry, Government institution or agency and Federal Government linked company."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_31",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Where an Innovation Ambassador is appointed under subsection (1), the Ministry, Government institution or agency and Federal Government linked company shall co-operate with the Innovation Ambassador. Power to employ agents, etc."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_32",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "32",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Agency may employ agents, experts, consultants or any other person as it deems fit to do any act required to be transacted or done in the performance of its functions, the exercise of its powers or the discharge of its duties or for the better carrying into effect the purposes of this Act. Power to establish companies, etc."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "33",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Agency may establish companies under the Companies Act 1965 [Act 125] to carry out and have the charge, conduct and management of any activities, projects or initiatives which have been planned or undertaken by the Agency in the performance of its functions or the exercise of its powers."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Agency may, in fulfilment of its functions and with the approval of the Prime Minister—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "enter into any partnership, joint venture, undertaking or any other form of co-operation or arrangement for the sharing of profits or carry on its activities in association with, or otherwise, any person, public authority or government carrying on or engaging in any such activities; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "take or otherwise acquire shares and securities in any public authority, corporation or other body dealing with the commercialization of innovation and may sell, hold or reissue such shares or securities or otherwise dispose of or deal with them."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subject to the approval of the Prime Minister and the Minister of Finance, the Agency shall divest its stakes in the companies established under subsection (1) within seven years of its establishment. Power to invest"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_34",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "34",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The moneys from the Innovation Fund in so far they are not required to be disbursed by the Agency under this Act, shall be invested in such manner as the Agency may determine subject to the approval of the Minister of Finance. Power to borrow"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_35",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "35",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Agency may, with the approval of the Prime Minister and Minister of Finance, borrow, at such rate of interest and for such period and upon such terms as to the time and method of repayment and otherwise as the Prime Minister and the Minister of Finance may approve, any sums required by the Agency for meeting any of its obligations or discharging any of its duties. Power to delegate functions and powers"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "36",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_4"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Agency may, in writing, delegate any of its functions and powers other than its power to employ agents, to borrow and to establish companies, to—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Chairman;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a member of the Council;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "a committee; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the Chief Executive Officer."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Chairman, a member of the Council, a committee or the Chief Executive Officer, as the case may be, delegated with such function or power shall be bound to observe and have regard to all conditions and restrictions imposed by the Agency and all requirements, procedures and matters specified by the Agency."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Any function or power delegated under this section shall be performed and exercised in the name and on behalf of the Agency."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_36",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A delegation under this section shall not preclude the Agency itself from performing or exercising at any time any of the delegated functions or powers. Power to endorse innovative products or services"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "37",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_7",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_8"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Agency may endorse, by way of certification, any product or service which comply with the criteria as determined by the Agency as an innovative product or service."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The endorsement under this section shall be for a maximum period of two years."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Agency shall cause to be published a list of all innovative products or services endorsed under subsection (1) in its official website."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_4",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Agency may, at any time before the expiry of the period specified in subsection (2), revoke the endorsement under this section if the innovative product or service no longer meets the criteria for endorsement as determined by the Agency under subsection (1)."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_5",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The owner of the product or service shall have no right of representation in respect of such revocation."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No endorsement under this section shall, by itself, entitle the owner of the product or service to—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any expectation of any business benefit; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any privileged treatment under any written law."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_7",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Agency shall not be liable in any way for any loss incurred as a result of the revocation of an endorsement under this section, and no cause of action shall lie against the Agency or the Government in respect of such revocation."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_8",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All Ministries, Government institutions or agencies and the Federal Government linked companies shall take into consideration of the innovative product or service in their procurement activities."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_28",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "28",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_28",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Agency shall establish a national intellectual property central depository."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_28",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All intellectual property which materialize from any research finding or project, whether fully or partially funded by the Government, shall be registered with the national intellectual property central depository."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_28__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_28",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "For the purposes of this Part, subsection (2) shall include existing intellectual property whether or not registered under any other written law. Acquisition of intellectual property"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_29",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "29",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_29__subsec_1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_29__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_29",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The intellectual property in any research finding or project which is fully or partially funded by the Government and any private body or organization may be acquired by the Agency subject to the terms of any agreement between the Agency and the private body or organization. ( 2) The Agency may acquire any intellectual property in any research finding or project which is privately owned by entering into agreement with the owner and the intellectual property acquired under this subsection shall be registered with the national intellectual property central depository. Right to promote, develop and commercialize intellectual property"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_30",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "30",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subject to subsection (2), the Agency shall have the right to promote, develop or commercialize any of the intellectual property which is registered with the national intellectual property central depository."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_30__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/41/eng@/~part_V__cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Agency shall, before promoting, developing or commercializing the intellectual property under section 29, obtain the consent from the owner of the intellectual property."
      }
    }
  ]
}
